    "created_at": "2015-09-21T13:08:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-21T13:08:19Z",
    "body": "I hadn't looked at what it actually does, indeed presentational attributes are usually non-conforming.\n\nThere's another problem here, namely that Blink also supports \"physical\" and \"on\" as aliases of \"hard\". Also, it's a presentation attribute for all values, mapping to `white-space: pre; word-wrap: normal` for \"off\" and `white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word` for any other attribute value.\n\n(This is from looking at code only, I haven't tested it.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
