    "created_at": "2015-09-21T17:20:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-21T17:20:32Z",
    "body": "@foolip rendering and semantics are already separated. Since \"off\" only has a rendering effect and is non-conforming it's only described in the rendering section. I think that makes sense.\n\nAs for the other values and styling, I suppose those are either not cross-browser or @Hixie missed them. But in either case that seems like it warrants a new report.\n\nI think this one can be closed.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
