    "created_at": "2015-09-21T17:46:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-21T17:46:18Z",
    "body": "I kind of think we should have at least an informative note near the other two keywords, saying \"there is also a non-conforming 'off' value that only affects rendering; see (rendering section)\". With my implementer hat on, it seems weird that you go look at the definition of textarea, you find an incomplete set of wrap values.\n",
